---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro";
import { BENCHMARK_METRICS, COMPARED, SYSTEM_SPECS, formatMetric } from "../../data/benchmarks";
---

<DocsLayout
  currentSlug="benchmarks"
  title="Performance"
  description="Corvene, GitHub Desktop and GitKraken measured on the same Mac, and how to run the numbers yourself."
>
  <p>
    All three apps ran on one {SYSTEM_SPECS.machine} on {COMPARED.date}, taking turns so none of them got a quieter
    machine than the others. Each number is a median of five runs.
  </p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th></th><th>Corvene</th><th>{COMPARED.githubDesktop}</th><th>{COMPARED.gitKraken}</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {BENCHMARK_METRICS.map((m) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{m.name}</td>
          <td><strong>{formatMetric(m.corvene, m.unit)}</strong></td>
          <td>{m.githubDesktop === null ? "–" : formatMetric(m.githubDesktop, m.unit)}</td>
          <td>{m.gitKraken === null ? <span class="text-fg-subtle">n/a</span> : formatMetric(m.gitKraken, m.unit)}</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 id="how">How it was measured</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Launch</strong> is from starting the executable to its first window on screen. Each app opened the
      repository it had open last.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Memory</strong> is the physical footprint (Activity Monitor's Memory column) after a minute idle, added up
      over every process the app runs. Corvene runs one, GitHub Desktop four, GitKraken seven.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Diff and next file</strong> use a generated repository with {SYSTEM_SPECS.fixture}, one of them 5,000 lines.
      Every app gets real input and the clock stops on the first frame that shows the new diff. GitKraken has no number for
      the next file because its list can't be moved through with the keyboard.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Other builds were running on the machine at the time, so all three are a little slower here than on an idle Mac.
  </p>

  <h2 id="reproduce">Running it yourself</h2>
  <p>Launch and memory, with GitHub Desktop and GitKraken installed:</p>
  <CodeBlock code={"cargo build --release -p corvene\npython3 tools/perf/apps.py --corvene-data <data dir with a repository added>"} />
  <p>The diff timings run on a generated repository. Corvene's side needs a build with the <code>snapshots</code> feature:</p>
  <CodeBlock
    code={"python3 tools/perf/fixture.py big target/perf/big\ncargo build --profile profiling -p corvene --features snapshots\npython3 tools/perf/bench.py --repo target/perf/big\npython3 tools/perf/apps_latency.py --repo target/perf/big"}
  />
  <p>Raw results from the run above are in <code>tools/perf/results/</code>.</p>
</DocsLayout>
